        "cooked": "<p>Well, about the silliness, I just meant I voted for Ansel’s tragically compromised face! <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/wink.png?v=12\" title=\":wink:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":wink:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p>But about my preferred option, I posted above:</p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group quote-modified\" data-username=\"Trajector\" data-post=\"11\" data-topic=\"28736\" data-full=\"true\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/trajector/48/1914_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Trajector:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters quote-modified\" data-username=\"fjur\" data-post=\"1\" data-topic=\"28736\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/fjur/48/4849_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> fjur:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>which Hero casualty … is the most tragic, and who will be missed the most.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>These are two separate questions!</p>\n<p>But I think the answer to both – even though he did not die – is Aata.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>",
